  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 91036662a85844eb162bdfbe2ea8ce9c, type: 3}
  m_Name: CanadianRules
  m_EditorClassIdentifier:
  displayName: Canadian
  description: 12x12 draughts - flying kings, men capture backward, mandatory maximum capture.
  longDescription: "<b>Board Size & Setup</b>\nPlayed on a massive 12x12 grid containing 144 total squares - only the 72 dark squares are used. Each player receives 30 pieces, completely filling the first five rows closest to each player and leaving just the middle two rows empty at the start.\n\n<b>Basic Movement</b>\nForward Only: regular pieces (men) can only step one square diagonally forward into an empty dark square - they cannot take standard steps backward.\n\n<b>Capture Mechanics</b>\nBackward Jumps: even though regular pieces cannot step backward, they can jump backward to capture an opponent's piece. Mandatory Maximum: capturing is completely mandatory, and if you have multiple choices for a jump sequence, you must choose the path that captures the highest number of pieces. The No-Removal Rule: captured pieces are not physically taken off the board until your entire multi-jump turn is fully complete - you cannot cross over or jump the same enemy piece twice during a single turn.\n\n<b>The Flying King</b>\nEnd-of-Turn Promotion: a piece only becomes a King if it finishes its entire turn and comes to a complete stop on the opponent's back row - if it jumps through the back row and lands elsewhere to continue a multi-capture, it remains a regular piece. Long-Range Flight: a King turns into a powerful long-range piece that can slide any number of empty squares along a diagonal line. Long-Range Jumps: a King can fly across the board to jump a distant, isolated enemy piece and choose exactly which empty square to land on behind it.\n\n<b>Winning the Game</b>\nElimination or Blockade: you win by capturing all 30 of your opponent's pieces or trapping them so they have zero legal moves left on their turn."
  rows: 12
  columns: 12
  pieceRowsPerSide: 5
  movementScheme: 0
  piecesOnAllSquares: 0
  leaveBackRowEmpty: 0
  flyingKings: 1
  menCaptureBackward: 1
  menCannotCaptureKings: 0
  mustCaptureMaximum: 1
  preferKingMover: 0
  preferKingCaptures: 0
  preferEarlierKingCapture: 0
  midChainPromotionRule: 0
  deferCaptureRemoval: 1
  forbidImmediateReversal: 0
  noProgressMoveLimit: 35
  singleManLosesToKing: 0
